# Mode marker for `vite build --mode staging` (see package.json's build:staging script). Vite
# loads this file for that mode, which is what gives `import.meta.env.MODE === "staging"` at
# runtime (see shared/config/environment.ts). All real values (API base URL, MSAL config, ...)
# are injected as process env vars by the CD Stage workflow, which take precedence over anything
# here — this file intentionally carries no values of its own.
